     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Obstructive HCM w persistent LVOTO Sx despite BB or NDHP CCB: add a myosin inhibitor (adults only), or disopyramide (w an AV-nodal blocker), or SRT @ experienced centers."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
